      "en": "which is as a bridegroom coming out of his room, like a strong man rejoicing to run his course.",
      "ko": "해는 그 방에서 나오는 신랑과 같고 그 길을 달리기 기뻐하는 장사 같아서",
      "source_text_hash": "5849f2f6daf45ae5b589ac17de2f5b698fd01e3d6d6d93e4b2e1741f1d7b6069",
      "translation_text_hash": "c960e371578b8432a61919bc433a2c514ac421345d1bccc610b0137a2a1c598f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
