      "en": "They are more to be desired than gold, yes, than much fine gold, sweeter also than honey and the extract of the honeycomb.",
      "ko": "금 곧 많은 정금보다 더 사모할 것이며 꿀과 송이꿀보다 더 달도다",
      "source_text_hash": "db956c14222551d7e01be24bdebd7fbf4c06ef7e1688e436e84d8160b0e96de1",
      "translation_text_hash": "22ad1a7232187c84571b76deb60d8a735ad96d64626014c4ce1dd004bd0cb617",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "금 곧 많은 정금보다 더 사모할 것이며 꿀과 송이꿀보다 더 달도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "22ad1a7232187c84571b76deb60d8a735ad96d64626014c4ce1dd004bd0cb617"
      ]
    },
